{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03284","headline":"使往天平军马约与陈子昂新乡爲期及还而不相遇 · 宋之问","name":"使往天平军马约与陈子昂新乡爲期及还而不相遇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入衞期之子，吁嗟不少留。\n情人去何处？淇水日悠悠。\n恒碣青云断，衡漳白露秋。\n知君心许国，不是爱封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}